{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_003_01_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:45231d9230c8cf21f6057955cbe58a02b139bc5e488d02e7ed61953c026349cc",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_c:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfa42f650b10e2b899cf73cbadc75f30b23680a9d361a2c2e8707058b5a7482f",
      "text": "而且成为偶像之后，\n收到天使君寄来的信也变多了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_c:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cac943bc71b6bafc54f2e1427052186822870a6da53c0b0fb0e23b592a18a2de",
      "text": "天使君会寄来什么样的内容呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ade13a0f08b008792e943d26d602c8cdaa37fd8ae05a1f188b2fc2997201848d",
      "text": "是非常热烈的心意哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96b94a9b5e0955fe522b222b1f76a850a10deb63ef2c721a674fc4080246b153",
      "text": "“被演唱会上的表现深深打动了”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_c:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa9e4f4ec636edfa86e00f5f9d3f65985447c5591e347d115338e721336b07de",
      "text": "“北斗君是我的偶像！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dad9d893048eb9f943e440761847969a3c3e8e3be2b430f3c9a7d4f2f2c4efe6",
      "text": "虽然当模特时也有很多男性粉丝支持我……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53188b997775ac45600556644c1a14016b77b755ab859dc80a6bc66c612d765d",
      "text": "但信里写的字字句句，\n总觉得饱含着更多热忱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:940f0861ace9af61c885465489b9cd782139489626f2ea4a0af7097ade460c49",
      "text": "或许是因为从冬马那里感染到的热忱，\n这次又传递到了大家身上吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be23dbc5185180916b7a1eb034a690e2fb385711f22637b2d621f0734bf0daf8",
      "text": "一定是这样的。我也从北斗先生的舞台上，\n感受到了那份激情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:384f1522fd7feb55793a2ec59c70cbaa65d863ca4554d2c330f1939a4df1c24a",
      "text": "正因如此，才更想以制作人的身份贡献力量！\n我由衷地这么觉得。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
